              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu abo baamala baaloba kuba beesigwa eri Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe. Baamuvaaku, baasinzanga emisambwa gy'abantu Katonda be yabinga mu nsi eyo nga beene Abaisiraeli bali kumpi okutuukayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
